    <shortDescription>
      <Value><![CDATA[I have been using the Vepo Envirotrax® system for many years on the Backflow Testing and Reporting side.  Vepo has been ahead of the curve with online submitting in my area before all the rest have entered the market. Vepo Envirotrax® has always been the easiest and fastest way to submit a backflow test.  The format is easy, clear, and without redundancy in data entry that can be burdensome with some other applications. If a water purveyor is in search of the total package to manage the tracking and implementation of a backflow prevention and customer service inspection program as the state of Texas requires, Vepo Envirotrax® must be at the top of the list.
                                ]]></Value>
    </shortDescription>
